    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365990/extras/c082b399aa41d7558abb8bad446c4177.avif?t=1754305919\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Have Fun!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash everything, get boosted, jump over trains, be first!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365990/extras/97dd317e7b42d244caa947d31881389b.poster.avif?t=1754305919\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365990/extras/97dd317e7b42d244caa947d31881389b.webm?t=1754305919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365990/extras/97dd317e7b42d244caa947d31881389b.mp4?t=1754305919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25<strong>Racing at Its Best!</strong>\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 Buckle up, hit the gas, and let's GO!\ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca8</p>",
